        <briefdescription>
<para>Perform hybrid search combining BM25 and vector search. </para>
        </briefdescription>
        <detaileddescription>
<para>Search.</para>
<para>Internally catches all exceptions from the index backends and returns whatever partial results are available, logging errors via THEMIS_ERROR. Never throws.</para>
<para><parameterlist kind="param"><parameteritem>
<parameternamelist>
<parametername>text_query</parametername>
</parameternamelist>
<parameterdescription>
<para>Text query for BM25 search (pass &quot;&quot; to skip BM25) </para>
</parameterdescription>
</parameteritem>
<parameteritem>
<parameternamelist>
<parametername>vector_query</parametername>
</parameternamelist>
<parameterdescription>
<para>Optional vector query for ANN search (nullptr to skip) </para>
</parameterdescription>
</parameteritem>
<parameteritem>
<parameternamelist>
<parametername>vector_dim</parametername>
</parameternamelist>
<parameterdescription>
<para>Dimension of vector_query; ignored when nullptr </para>
</parameterdescription>
</parameteritem>
<parameteritem>
<parameternamelist>
<parametername>stats</parametername>
</parameternamelist>
<parameterdescription>
<para>Optional output: filled with per-source diagnostics </para>
</parameterdescription>
</parameteritem>
</parameterlist>
<simplesect kind="return"><para>Fused results ranked by hybrid score; may be partial if one source failed (indicated by stats.partial_result == true)</para>
</simplesect>
<parameterlist kind="param"><parameteritem>
<parameternamelist>
<parametername direction="in">text_query</parametername>
</parameternamelist>
<parameterdescription>
<para>Input parameter. </para>
