<para>When set, <computeroutput><ref refid="namespacethemis_1_1search" kindref="compound">search()</ref></computeroutput> applies the re-ranker as a final step after RRF fusion: the top-N fused results are scored by the LLM and returned in the re-ranked order. Calling with a null <computeroutput>backend</computeroutput> removes any previously attached re-ranker (falls back to RRF order).</para>
